WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.868
Russia could be gaining an

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.902
upper hand in

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.505
what is a fierce battle for Bakhmut.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.174
British intelligence says that Moscow

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.175
is regaining

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.611
some momentum and has likely advanced

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:14.414
as far as the a town center there.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.282
In a report out today, the U.K.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.417
also said

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.051
that fighters

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:18.752
from the

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.153
both the Russian military

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.422
and that private Varg knit group

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.691
have paused their ongoing feud

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:27.560
and are now cooperating better.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:29.129
Elsewhere in Ukraine,

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:29.896
at least seven

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.498
people were injured by shelling

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.266
in the southern region.

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:33.967
That's according

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.603
to the military administration there.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.071
Want to get you to Nick

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:38.805
Paton Walsh,

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:39.973
who is in Kiev

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:42.976
with more on all of these developments.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:43.943
And let's start,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.911
if we can,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.379
with what we understand

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.248
to be happening in Baku,

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.049
which at the moment,

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:52.585
I mean, this has been a month long battle

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.155
now sort of described as

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.223
sort of the epicenter of this war.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.225
Just just provided some context

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.961
if you will, and any detail that we have

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.066
Look, I mean, the information

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:06.766
in this U.K.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.068
intelligence report suggests

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:08.968
in their assessment

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:09.903
and these are

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.571
people who are continuing

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.073
analyzing everything they can lay

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.541
their hands on at a nature level.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.341
They believe that

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.410
Russia is seeing incremental progress,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.812
some sense of momentum.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.080
But you have to remember, Becky,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.948
in the broader picture of all of this,

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.183
this is a task that way.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.651
Back at the beginning of the winter,

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:25.018
Russia

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.019
thought it might be able to achieve

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.087
in a matter of weeks.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.321
And it is still now,

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.689
and you might argue six,

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.791
eight months, even continuing this.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.427
Inch by inch bid to get more of it

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.929
back, moved in its hands.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.330
Now, we've seen images today

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.099
suggesting that in the back

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:39.866
moving market,

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.600
there was continued

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.235
fighting with Ukrainian troops.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.903
That's pretty much central.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.772
At the same time, to their indications,

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:46.606
all the fighting is around

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.874
the train station, too.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.276
So Ukraine still with forces in the West.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.044
It does appear

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.179
the Russians have crossed over the river

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.514
and appear to have done

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.982
what they can to suggest

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:58.218
a stronger presence inside of that city.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.320
But it comes at a staggering cost.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.788
And of course, that is draining

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.956
resources of Russia,

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.125
which are already significantly depleted.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.092
So add to that

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.861
to another problem for Moscow.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:08.428
In the while,

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.262
they've been

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.063
pretty much throwing

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:10.430
everything

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.565
they can at trying to take back moves

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:14.701
that has allowed Ukraine,

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.703
possibly elsewhere in the country,

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:17.837
a chance to reset

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:19.005
or get ready for any counter

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.174
offensive coming as well.

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:23.476
They back back is of limited

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.811
strategic value.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.446
Most assess it will enable them.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:27.213
Certainly Russia,

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.148
if they take all of it

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.149
to have a better vantage

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:30.683
for other parts of Donbass,

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:31.951
they want to take as well.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:32.952
But they've exhausted

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.120
so many thousands, it

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.157
seems, of troops in this particular fight

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.791
and it's dragged on so long.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.159
But I think

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.528
any eventual final outcome of this battle

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:42.495
which Ukraine is

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.797
very keen to not let go of,

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.799
will come at a substantial cost

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:47.700
for Moscow Becky.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.672
Nick, the Pentagon investigating

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.640
what appears

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.876
to be screenshots of classified U.S.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.612
and NATO military information

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:00.947
about Ukraine,

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.983
which is circulating on social media.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:04.484
I know that

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:05.952
we've had that confirmed

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:08.354
at least by a Pentagon official.

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:12.091
Do we have any more on this

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:13.927
Now, I have to be level with you, Becky.

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:16.029
This whole story is extremely odd.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:16.963
The Pentagon have not

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:17.730
publicly said

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.033
that these are authentic documents.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:20.667
And there's certainly

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:22.502
a lot of people wondering why on earth

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:23.736
if this was this one

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.071
narrative suggests

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:26.339
confidential information

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:27.707
obtained by Russia,

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:29.409
why would they tweak it as appears

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:30.243
to have been the case

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.311
and then posted up

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:33.446
on various social media channels?

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.881
It completely belie

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:35.882
the point of having

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.083
that confidential advantage

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:38.484
of knowing what your enemies assessment

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:39.719
of your capabilities

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.088
or Ukraine's capabilities. Indeed, are.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.323
So that's also odd

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.091
to we've heard from Ukrainian officials

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:45.491
who are saying

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:46.659
this is all part of standard

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:48.928
Russian misinformation operation.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:50.330
And Moscow

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.531
haven't directly commented

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:52.532
on this at all.

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.733
So it's an odd

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.702
piece of information to see out there.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:56.402
There are suggestions

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.637
perhaps some of this information

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.372
may have been doctored or may be old,

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.406
but it really isn't clear

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.641
where it originated. From.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.809
But it adds to one thing,

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:03.843
and that's the general sense

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:05.011
of anticipation

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.346
here, certainly

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:07.914
about when this counteroffensive

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:08.648
may begin.

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:10.250
We've had so much misinformation

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.718
over the past months particularly

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:12.919
when it came to the previous

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:13.720
Ukrainian counter

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.221
offensive back in the summer,

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:16.256
suggesting where

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:17.123
or they may

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:19.425
or may not choose to begin that fight.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.293
But I think we should look

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:21.194
at these documents

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:22.562
whatever they really are

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.731
in that particular perspective.

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:26.032
And it remains to be seen

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:27.934
quite what they genuinely are.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.702
But it does add to that broad sense

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.170
that something is certainly coming

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:31.871
and it's Ukraine's

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:32.705
turn on the battlefield

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:34.540
to make a move forward Becky.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.108
Yeah.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:36.809
Unclear when and what,

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:37.610
if anything, either

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.679
side knows about the other

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:41.314
others preparations for it.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:45.551
Given your account there of it

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:46.519
being very unclear

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:46.986
what it is

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:49.389
that is circulating at this point.

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:50.223
Nick, it's

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:51.224
good to have you that Nick

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:53.359
Paton Walsh is in Ukraine to you folks.

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:55.595
Well, in northern north eastern Ukraine,

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:57.964
things are relatively calm

00:04:57.964 --> 00:04:59.065
in the hockey region

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:00.600
near the Russian border.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.635
Still Ukrainian forces

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.304
preparing for battle there.

00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:06.439
CNN's Ben Wedeman found time to speak

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:07.607
