00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:10.843
soldiers as they shore up their defenses

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:11.411
have a look at this.

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:16.382
Zhenya prepares

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:18.651
