00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.091
Russian forces are nearby

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:27.727
This position

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:28.461
on the northern

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:30.163
edge of the Kharkiv region

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.532
hasn't seen much action of late,

00:05:32.532 --> 00:05:35.034
but the men here have seen plenty.

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:37.236
Elsewhere, in January,

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:38.571
Zhenya was in a front line

00:05:38.571 --> 00:05:40.707
foxhole in Donbass patrol.

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:42.442
From early in the morning.

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:44.110
They would shell us with artillery,

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.111
and right afterwards

00:05:45.111 --> 00:05:46.713
their infantry would try

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:48.815
to take our positions, he recalls.

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:51.250
You could see them.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.051
Much of the area

00:05:52.051 --> 00:05:54.220
south of here saw vicious combat.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.421
Last September,

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:56.489
Ukrainian forces

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:57.857
