00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:05.431
era communications tower.

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:06.733
Scorched earth.

00:06:06.733 --> 00:06:08.868
Their tactic of choice.

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:10.036
This position, manned

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.671
by the 209th Battalion

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:12.872
of the Ukrainian Army's

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:16.409
113th Brigade, is holding steady.

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:19.445
Defense, not offense, is the order of

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:20.046
the day.

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:21.581
Alexi

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:22.982
was a
nuclear physicist

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:24.751
before picking up a gun.

00:06:24.751 --> 00:06:26.819
We have enough ammunition

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.955
and we have enough weapons and

00:06:31.124 --> 00:06:33.693
different armor equipment.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.796
But it's all for defense

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:39.899
equipment for the counterattack.

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:42.235
It will be better because of you.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:44.670
So now free will help

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:48.941
The weapons they have are hardly

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:50.309
the latest.

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:51.210
The troops showed us

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:54.046
a Swedish made recoilless rocket launcher

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:57.116
dating back to 1978.

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.285
They defend their position

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:01.387
with other decades old methods

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:03.723
beyond this razor wire.

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:06.526
Just on the other side are land mines

00:07:07.126 --> 00:07:07.894
Fortunately,

00:07:07.894 --> 00:07:10.763
this area is relatively quiet,

00:07:11.964 --> 00:07:13.132
which is a welcome

00:07:13.132 --> 00:07:15.802
respite for these battle scarred troops.

00:07:16.235 --> 00:07:17.403
No phone booth was a

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:19.539
nightmare is how you have gone describes

00:07:19.539 --> 00:07:21.274
the battle in the dead of winter

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:22.341
in Donbas.

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:24.710
I'll remember it for the rest of my life.

00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:26.345
52 year

00:07:26.345 --> 00:07:28.147
old Vitale served with Russians

00:07:28.147 --> 00:07:29.949
in the Soviet army.

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:32.485
This war has severed old ties.

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.621
You listen to we ate from the same pot

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:37.590
he says, reminiscing of his days

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.592
as a young recruit.

00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:40.793
That was then.

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:43.362
This is now, after so many battles.

00:07:43.563 --> 00:07:45.998
They prepare for the next

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:47.300
Ben Wedeman, CNN,

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.101
in the northern Kharkiv region.

