There's diplomacy

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.232
and then there is deal making

00:09:26.265 --> 00:09:28.100
Let's first talk about diplomacy,

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.435
because all the attention

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:30.670
has been focused

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.604
on China's

00:09:31.604 --> 00:09:33.272
influence in Russia

00:09:33.272 --> 00:09:35.241
and the war in Ukraine.

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:38.177
We just got some remarks reported by

00:09:38.177 --> 00:09:39.512
Chinese state media

00:09:39.512 --> 00:09:41.681
within the last few hours

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:45.184
in which President Xi is quoted as saying

00:09:45.551 --> 00:09:47.253
the war should not drag on

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:49.322
and that there should be a ceasefire.

00:09:49.522 --> 00:09:50.723
But as we have witnessed

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:52.091
during this visit,

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:53.225
both sides

00:09:53.225 --> 00:09:54.794
meeting France and China

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:55.861
really have not wavered

00:09:55.861 --> 00:09:57.330
from their positions.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.131
France really blaming

00:09:59.131 --> 00:10:01.334
Russia for it for this war.

00:10:01.334 --> 00:10:04.236
And China not necessarily condemning

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:07.273
Russia for its involvement in this war.

00:10:07.306 --> 00:10:09.375
So things in many ways are still

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:10.209
status quo.

00:10:10.209 --> 00:10:11.444
Despite these remarks,

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:11.978
no one

00:10:11.978 --> 00:10:13.446
really is making any kind

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:15.781
of wholesale shift in position

00:10:16.015 --> 00:10:17.416
However, according to French

00:10:17.416 --> 00:10:18.818
diplomatic sources, President

00:10:18.818 --> 00:10:20.686
Xi has agreed

00:10:20.686 --> 00:10:24.657
to take a call with Vladimir Zelinski

00:10:24.991 --> 00:10:27.059
when the time is right at the right

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:28.060
moment is the wording that

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.061
we have been reporting.

